WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.108 --> 00:00:04.269
Bajie looked out the kitchen window.

2
00:00:04.289 --> 00:00:07.050
Wukong and Wujing were outside talking.

3
00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:12.332
"Wukong, Wujing," said the pig quietly.

4
00:00:12.773 --> 00:00:13.033
over here.

5
00:00:13.053 --> 00:00:30.940
I want to tell you something."

6
00:00:31.020 --> 00:00:33.362
The two companions came over to the window.

7
00:00:33.382 --> 00:00:35.464
"What is it?"

8
00:00:35.744 --> 00:00:36.545
asked Wujing.

9
00:00:36.565 --> 00:00:40.128
"I heard the two priests talking," said the pig.

10
00:00:40.148 --> 00:00:43.150
"There's a ginseng tree at this abbey.

11
00:00:44.471 --> 00:00:46.853
They said its fruit is delicious and valuable."

12
00:00:48.174 --> 00:00:49.235
Wukong smiled.

13
00:00:49.255 --> 00:00:51.617
"The fruit must taste wonderful."

14
00:00:51.637 --> 00:00:54.359
"We should eat some," said Wujing.

15
00:00:55.800 --> 00:00:56.741
rubbed his belly.

16
00:00:57.342 --> 00:00:58.743
"Yes," he said.

17
00:00:58.763 --> 00:01:01.092
"We should."

18
00:01:01.352 --> 00:01:02.853
two wait here," said Wukong.

19
00:01:02.873 --> 00:01:05.133
"I'll go pick some of that fruit."

20
00:01:08.674 --> 00:01:12.355
The monkey went behind the abbey and found the giant ginseng tree.

21
00:01:13.196 --> 00:01:15.096
The fruit sparkled in the sunlight.

22
00:01:18.297 --> 00:01:23.058
He plucked three pieces from the tree's branches and went back to the kitchen.

23
00:01:24.839 --> 00:01:28.420
He handed Bajie and Wujing each a ginseng fruit.

24
00:01:30.185 --> 00:01:30.745
took a bite.

25
00:01:30.765 --> 00:01:34.708
"This fruit is delicious!"

26
00:01:34.788 --> 00:01:37.430
"Yes," said Wukong.

27
00:01:37.450 --> 00:01:39.271
"It truly is."

28
00:01:40.512 --> 00:01:44.554
Bajie opened his mouth wide and threw his ginseng fruit in.

29
00:01:45.815 --> 00:01:50.499
"Bajie, you should be ashamed of yourself," said Wukong.

30
00:01:51.259 --> 00:01:52.660
"You didn't even chew!"

31
00:01:52.680 --> 00:01:56.883
"I was too hungry to chew," said the pig.

32
00:01:59.280 --> 00:01:59.921
He groaned.

33
00:01:59.941 --> 00:02:03.423
"And now I wish I had another ginseng fruit.

34
00:02:04.243 --> 00:02:06.004
I didn't even taste that one!"

35
00:02:07.705 --> 00:02:11.427
At that moment the two priests were walking past the kitchen.

36
00:02:11.447 --> 00:02:14.149
"Did you hear what the pig said?"

37
00:02:14.389 --> 00:02:15.469
whispered one priest.

38
00:02:15.489 --> 00:02:19.191
"I think the Tang Monk's companions are eating the ginseng fruit!"

39
00:02:20.212 --> 00:02:23.954
The two priests ran outside and searched the ginseng tree.

40
00:02:25.295 --> 00:02:27.316
Three pieces of fruit were gone.

41
00:02:29.240 --> 00:02:30.100
"This is terrible!"

42
00:02:30.381 --> 00:02:31.241
said one priest.

43
00:02:31.261 --> 00:02:34.322
"The Great Immortal will be very upset!"

44
00:02:35.883 --> 00:02:38.544
They ran inside and found the Tang Monk.

45
00:02:38.564 --> 00:02:41.785
"Your companions are criminals!"

46
00:02:42.125 --> 00:02:43.166
shouted one priest.

47
00:02:43.186 --> 00:02:45.287
"What are you talking about?"

48
00:02:45.667 --> 00:02:46.287
asked the monk.

49
00:02:46.307 --> 00:02:49.908
"They stole some of our ginseng fruit!"

50
00:02:50.229 --> 00:02:51.229
said the other priest.

51
00:02:52.409 --> 00:02:56.211
Just then Wukong, Bajie, and Wujing walked in.

52
00:02:56.231 --> 00:02:59.693
"Thieves!" cried the first priest.

53
00:03:01.713 --> 00:03:03.234
dare you call us thieves!"

54
00:03:03.594 --> 00:03:04.535
shouted Bajie.

55
00:03:04.555 --> 00:03:06.416
"What did we steal?"

56
00:03:06.496 --> 00:03:09.277
"Don't pretend you don't know!"

57
00:03:09.617 --> 00:03:10.597
said the other priest.

58
00:03:10.617 --> 00:03:14.399
"You ate ginseng fruit from our master's tree!"

59
00:03:16.200 --> 00:03:19.241
Wujing wiped some juice from the side of his mouth.

60
00:03:19.922 --> 00:03:21.922
Wukong giggled.

61
00:03:22.963 --> 00:03:23.983
"What is so funny?"

62
00:03:24.263 --> 00:03:25.164
asked the other priest.

63
00:03:26.821 --> 00:03:28.882
laughed harder and pointed at Bajie.

64
00:03:28.902 --> 00:03:31.424
"It was his idea!"

65
00:03:31.504 --> 00:03:34.567
"You're the one who stole the fruit!"

66
00:03:34.807 --> 00:03:35.548
cried the pig.

67
00:03:35.568 --> 00:03:38.330
"You're all thieves and liars!"

68
00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:39.811
cried one of the priests.

69
00:03:39.831 --> 00:03:42.913
"We invited you into our abbey as guests!

70
00:03:43.674 --> 00:03:45.876
And you repay us by stealing from us!"

71
00:03:46.857 --> 00:03:49.118
The two priests yelled and yelled.

72
00:03:49.559 --> 00:03:53.222
They called Wukong and his companions all sorts of terrible names.

73
00:03:53.242 --> 00:03:56.745
"I don't want to listen to this," thought the monkey.

74
00:03:57.405 --> 00:04:01.107
He recited a quick spell and changed into a spirit form.

75
00:04:01.948 --> 00:04:06.131
He left his body standing in the room and went out behind the abbey.

76
00:04:07.832 --> 00:04:10.053
Wukong stood before the ginseng tree.

77
00:04:10.073 --> 00:04:13.776
"Those priests are rude!"

78
00:04:14.096 --> 00:04:15.017
he said to himself.

79
00:04:15.037 --> 00:04:18.439
"So what if we ate some ginseng fruit?

80
00:04:19.119 --> 00:04:21.141
They have no right to call us names!"

81
00:04:23.943 --> 00:04:25.724
Wukong grew very angry.

82
00:04:28.573 --> 00:04:32.336
Finally he took out his iron bar and struck the tree.

83
00:04:33.597 --> 00:04:37.980
There was a loud crack, and the entire tree crashed to the ground.

84
00:04:38.841 --> 00:04:43.364
Wukong put the iron bar back in his ear and returned to his body.

85
00:04:44.225 --> 00:04:46.146
The priests were still yelling.

86
00:04:46.166 --> 00:04:48.708
"Stop yelling!"

87
00:04:48.968 --> 00:04:50.029
commanded Wukong.

88
00:04:51.130 --> 00:04:54.292
The priests stopped yelling and looked at the monkey.

89
00:04:55.409 --> 00:04:59.138
"I think you made a mistake," said the monkey with a big smile.

90
00:04:59.158 --> 00:05:04.251
"Why don't you go outside to your ginseng tree and count the fruit again?"
